WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Sit with the legs extended, then bend the right knee, foot flat.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Inhale and lengthen the spine tall.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Exhale and twist toward the bent knee, hooking the opposite elbow.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Gaze over the back shoulder. Switch sides.
